d $M$ are diagonal matrices."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186276851 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "09fa0899-a3d2-584f-8cdd-a471f8cfd16b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Special Square Matrix"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b8fae28e-b902-55ef-a9b5-781249b00a5e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$S$ and $R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276853} {:answer/id #uuid "5021e49e-0e17-5eec-83fe-cbee2f4dc182" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$S$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276854} {:answer/id #uuid "d2a7224a-838c-59f3-bef1-956080792f32" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$Y$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276855} {:answer/id #uuid "38072c74-8acc-596d-8707-55cbbd8504c8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$S$ and $Y$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276856} {:answer/id #uuid "bf3cc945-125c-5d50-8485-bc03d6f61a22" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$R$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276857}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5021e49e-0e17-5eec-83fe-cbee2f4dc182" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$S$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276854} :answer-field/id #uuid "82d6edac-bfe3-5484-8ef9-9bb4cea1e5bd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276852}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c0fa1b96-0701-5539-993f-8523f6af2e59" :question/math-academy-id "q-68745" :question/problem "Which of the following are diagonal matrices?\n\n$$\nS=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}],\\,R=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,Y=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "- $S$ is a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. Also, all the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nNotice that $S$ is not an identity matrix since the diagonal entries are not all ones.\n\n- $R$ is *not* a diagonal matrix since it's not a square matrix.\n\n- $Y$ is *not* a diagonal matrix. It's a square matrix since it has the same number of rows and columns. But some of the entries that do not lie on the main diagonal are not zeros (for instance, ${y}_{31}=1\\ne 0$).\n\nTherefore, only $S$ is a diagonal matrix."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186276858 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7b6ddadb-471a-5195-a0f5-fd44bdc8f780" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Other Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cb629807-a2b6-51cd-83c4-fd8091fc2744" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$A$ and $C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276860} {:answer/id #uuid "d5aef63d-5472-5063-bb92-4e962549ff7e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$A$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276861} {:answer/id #uuid "f7b639b9-8a4a-5810-9d66-b4c6f11d1cee" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$ and $C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276862} {:answer/id #uuid "b48cc6cd-be53-50f3-ba07-9843f9339bcb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276863} {:answer/id #uuid "51a97624-6c98-5f12-85e6-2ee0dde73c4d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$B$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276864}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b48cc6cd-be53-50f3-ba07-9843f9339bcb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$C$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276863} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a6ae890-9680-5e0e-bc09-58d05189536b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186276859}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #ed